clause (b) and clause (c), the word "animals" shall include all animal life, including mammals, birds, fish, crustaceans, molluscs, reptiles, and living organisms;

(iii)

clause (c), the word "products" shall include those obtained from live animals without further processing, including milk, eggs, natural honey, hair, wool, semen and dung obtained from live animals referred to in clause (b); and,

